      "why": "It explicitly names missing head-to-head evidence and states what controlled benchmark would settle the question."
    },
    {
      "name": "Structure serves the reader",
      "evidence": "## Comparative Performance and Hallucination Mitigation ... ## Open Questions and Research Gaps ... ## Practical Recommendations",
