      "why": "Headings and bullets make key facts findable, but the structure does not fully serve the stated comparison because long-context performance is not separately developed."
    },
    {
      "name": "No padding",
      "evidence": "Prioritize RAG for Safety-Critical Domains: Implement retrieval-augmented generation pipelines ... to dramatically curb hallucination rates in high-stakes environments like healthcare and pharmaceuticals",
